    {
      "name": "export",
      "description": "Read every item out in the clear through locker.export, so this device can write a plaintext file. This is a mass reveal: it is confirmed, it is receipted as an unseal of every sealed column it touches, it is online-only, and asked for on a device that is not the owner's it parks for their confirmation. Anything that reads the file reads your secrets.",
